  "translation": "Na bel bilong Avner i hat nogut long ol tok bilong Ish-Boshet, na em i tok: Mi yet em hed bilong dok bilong Yehuda? Todei mi wokim khesed wantaim haus bilong Shaul papa bilong yu, long ol brata bilong em na long poro bilong em, na mi no givim yu long han bilong David — na yu lukautim ⟨long⟩ mi long rong bilong dispela meri todei?",
